 "note": "Strings 0..5 = low E..high e. strum grid tokens: D/U down/up, d/u light, \">\" accent, \"p\" suffix palm-muted, x dead-muted chuck, \"-\" rest. Down hits all strings (low to high), up hits the top 3 (G B e = 3..5, high to low; set \"up4\" adds the D string) unless stroke_strings overrides. Timing defaults (ms): down per-string spread 5-12, up 4-9, stroke duration 90-160 shrinking with tempo; see strum_model.js.",
